guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:title=Guide Book
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:desc=Welcome to §vMore Pumpkins§r! This Add-On adds new carved pumpkins to your world!\n\n
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.carved_pumpkin=Carved Pumpkin
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.carved_pumpkin.desc=Used to craft jack o'lanterns.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r §cNo§r\n\n§lObtain:§r Obtained by using a Carving Knife on an uncarved pumpkin.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.jack_o_lantern=Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.jack_o_lantern.desc=A carved pumpkin with a torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (15)\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Torch under a Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.soul_jack_o_lantern=Soul Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.soul_jack_o_lantern.desc=A carved pumpkin with a soul torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (8)\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Soul Torch under a Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.copper_jack_o_lantern=Copper Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.copper_jack_o_lantern.desc=A carved pumpkin with a copper torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (14)\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Copper Torch under a Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.redstone_jack_o_lantern=Redstone Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.redstone_jack_o_lantern.desc=A carved pumpkin with a redstone torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (15) (when lit)\n\n§lUsage:§r A redstone jack o'lantern can be used to produce switchable light.\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Redstone Torch under a Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_pumpkin=Pale Pumpkin
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_pumpkin.desc=A pale variant of a pumpkin.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r §cNo§r\n\n§lObtain:§r Generates in the Pale Garden.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_carved_pumpkin=Pale Carved Pumpkin
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_carved_pumpkin.desc=Used to craft pale jack o'lanterns.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r §cNo§r\n\n§lObtain:§r Obtained by using a Carving Knife on an uncarved pale pumpkin.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_jack_o_lantern=Pale Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_jack_o_lantern.desc=A pale carved pumpkin with a torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (15)\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Torch under a Pale Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_soul_jack_o_lantern=Pale Soul Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_soul_jack_o_lantern.desc=A pale carved pumpkin with a soul torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (8)\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Soul Torch under a Pale Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_redstone_jack_o_lantern=Pale Redstone Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_redstone_jack_o_lantern.desc=A pale carved pumpkin with a redstone torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (15) (when lit)\n\n§lUsage:§r A redstone jack o'lantern can be used to produce switchable light.\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Redstone Torch under a Pale Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_copper_jack_o_lantern=Pale Copper Jack o'Lantern
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:blocks.pale_copper_jack_o_lantern.desc=A pale carved pumpkin with a copper torch inside.\n\n§lTool:§r Axe\n\n§lBlast Resistance:§r 1\n\n§lHardness:§r 1\n\n§lLuminous:§r Yes (14)\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted by placing a Copper Torch under a Pale Carved Pumpkin in the crafting grid.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:creator=Creator
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:creator.desc=§lDiscord Server:§r\nJoin the community at §vdiscord.lpsmods.dev§r for Add-On help, updates, and creator discussion.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs=Changelogs
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v100=v1.0.0
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v100.desc=- Initial release\n
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v110=v1.1.0
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v110.desc=- Minimum version 1.19.40\n- Removed give functions, you can obtain all blocks via the creative inventory.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v120=v1.2.0
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v120.desc=- Updated for 1.19.80\n- Requires Assets Plus v1.4.0\n- Blocks now use unit_cube instead of custom geometry\n- You can now craft all blocks by placing any carved, jack o' lantern, or soul jack o' lantern in a stonecutter.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v200=v2.0.0
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v200.desc=- Updated for 1.21.114\n- Now requires Assets+ 2.0.0\n- All pumpkins have been moved to the Nature tab and are in their own groups.\n- Renamed skeleton pumpkin to skull.\n- Removed stonecutter recipes.\n\n§lNew§r\n\n- Added guide book.\n- Added carving knives.\n- Added pale pumpkin along with all carved and lit variants.\n- Added redstone and copper variants.\n- New patterns\n  - angler\n  - archer\n  - arms up\n  - blade\n  - brewer\n  - burn\n  - danger\n  - explorer\n  - flow\n  - friend\n  - guster\n  - heart\n  - heartbreak\n  - howl\n  - miner\n  - mourner\n  - plenty\n  - prize\n  - scrape\n  - sheaf\n  - shelter\n  - snort\n  - dispenser\n  - dropper\n  - crafter\n
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v201=v2.0.1 §v[Installed]§r
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:changelogs.v201.desc=- Added `Creator` tab to the guide book.\n- Added public API to add your own carving knife recipes.\n
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:items.guide_book.desc=A reference that explains new blocks, items, and mechanics added by this Add-On.\n\n§lStackable:§r No\n\n§lUsage:§r An interface to help you understand everything added by the Add-On.\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted with a Book and a Pumpkin.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:items.carving_knife=Carving Knife
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:items.carving_knife.desc=A knife that lets you choose and carve designs into pumpkins.\n\n§lStackable:§r No\n\n§lUsage:§r Click :_input_key.use: to change the pattern.\n\nNow, click :_input_key.attack: when looking at a pumpkin to carve the pattern.\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted with Flint and any Sword.
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:items.pale_pumpkin_pie=Pale Pumpkin Pie
guide.lpsm_more_pumpkins:items.pale_pumpkin_pie.desc=A pale variant of Pumpkin Pie.\n\n§lStackable:§r Yes (64)\n\n§lRestores:§r 8 hunger\n\n§lObtain:§r Crafted with a Pale Pumpkin, Sugar, and any Egg.\n\n§lUsage:§r Can be eaten by holding :_input_key.use: while it is selected in the hotbar.
